('NZ:software-developer','2026-08-10',null,58.65,122000,15,0,0,0,15,10,0,8,5,53,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 261312 Developer Programmer; Software Developer is an ANZSCO specialisation and matches the canonical coding scope.','shortage_note','Current Green List Tier 1 status is used as a strong but conditional policy-demand signal; 15/20 because the pathway has a high remuneration threshold.','visa_basis','Green List Tier 1 can support Straight to Residence, but the current ICT threshold is NZD 72.80/hour; typical Tahatu midpoint is below that threshold; 8/10.','salary_method','Midpoint of Tahatu current most-common Software Developer annual pay range NZD 90,000-154,000; 10/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū allows advanced certificate/diploma or intensive software training routes alongside experience; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory occupational licence or register; 5/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
('NZ:data-analyst','2026-08-10',null,45.91,95500,0,0,0,0,12,8,0,3,5,28,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Canonical technology Data Analyst has no exact ANZSCO 1.3 occupation. ANZSCO 224114 is an Australian-only later update, while NOL 224118 is explicitly Data Analyst (Non-ICT), so no primary immigration code is forced.','shortage_note','No Green List or recurring occupation-specific shortage credit is used.','visa_basis','A specific NZ job must be matched to the applicable current occupation classification by its duties; classification ambiguity is scored conservatively at 3/10.','salary_method','Midpoint of Tahatu current most-common Data Analyst annual pay range NZD 73,000-118,000; 8/10.','entry_basis','Relevant quantitative or computing tertiary study plus practical analytics skills; 12/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory occupational registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
('NZ:data-engineer','2026-08-10',null,50.24,104500,0,0,0,0,10,10,0,3,5,28,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Data Engineer has no exact ANZSCO 1.3 occupation. Programmer, database and systems codes can apply to particular jobs by duties, but no proxy is promoted to the canonical code.','shortage_note','No Green List status is borrowed from programmer or database occupations; shortage 0/20.','visa_basis','Duty-based classification is required for a specific AEWV/SMC case; conservative 3/10.','salary_method','Midpoint of Tahatu Data Warehousing Specialist annual pay range NZD 62,000-147,000, used as the closest transparent data-platform proxy; 10/10.','entry_basis','Relevant computing/data study and practical data-platform experience are normally expected; 10/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory occupational registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
